Question 3
I want all users who have never placed an order

Sol 1) select c.CustomerID, c.CustName
from Customers C left join orders o
on c.CustomerID = o.CustomerID
where o.CustomerID is null;

Sol 2)select c.CustomerID,c.CustName
from Customers c 
where not exists (select 1
                  from orders o
                  where o.CustomerID = c.CustomerID)
